  <content>
  <section><para>Consider the two relations below. Which statement is true about both relations?</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>{\((−3,−6),(−2,−4),(−1,−2),(0,0),(1,2),(2,4),(3,6)\)}</item>
  <item>{\((8,−4),(4,−2),(2,−1),(0,0),(2,1),(4,2),(8,4)\)}</item>
</list></section>
</content>
